{"completed": true, "response": "这份亲近本身可能就带着一种温柔、暖暖的感觉。也正因为这份靠近变得让人珍惜，他心里的顾虑也更明显了：他想靠近对方，却也舍不得自己原本自由自在、不受牵绊的状态。所以，这份甜蜜里多了一点点不安。越是感受到靠近的吸引力，他就越隐约觉得，继续靠近也可能影响到自己珍惜的个人空间。这并不是在担心对方会不会回应，也不是打算收回自己的心意，只是想靠近对方和想保留自己的自由，这两种心情都在这份温柔里变得更加真切了。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a436076b-f85c-4492-93cb-0e84f51efbca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002946905631Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.141, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:29:54.046178+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5ade09623278c277ac12c211f5fc6161044f1266e937fb490f351bc79c58d5ae", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T002946905631Z", "files": ["proof-offline